age 14
IV=2DC=3A DETAILED EXAMPLE OF CREATING SPECIAL FILES

    In order to use the mknod utility to create the device special files fo=
r an
    HSZ40 unit=2C the following pieces of information are required=3A

    1=2E The SCSI Bus number of the host side SCSI bus=2E
    2=2E The target ID of the HSZ40 unit as shown in the HSZ40 unit number
    3=2E The LUN of the HSZ40 unit as shown in the HSZ40 unit number=2E
    4=2E The partition for the device=2C a =2D h=2E

    The major number of HSZ40 disk units is always =228=22=2E  The minor nu=
mber
    will be calculated as follows=3A

  =2816384 * Host Side SCSI Bus Number=29 =2B =281024 * Target ID=29 =2B =
=2864 * LUN=29 =2B x

    The =22x=22 in the formula is the partition number as follows=3A

    a =3D 0
    b =3D 1
    c =3D 2=2C and so on=2E

    For an HSZ40 unit D200 on host side SCSI Bus =23 2; the SCSI Bus is 2=
=2C
    the Target ID is 2 and the LUN number is 0=2E The minor number
    for the =22a=22 partition would be=3A

    =28 16384 * 2=29 =2B =28 1024 * 2 =29 =2B =28 64 * 0 =29 =2B 0 =3D 3481=
6

    The =22nn=22 portion of the name would be 18=2C as determined by the fo=
rmula
     nn =3D =28 8 * Host Side SCSI Bus =23 =29 =2B =28 Target ID from HSZ40=
 unit number=29

    The special file name for the block mode device would be rza18a=2E
    The special file name for the character mode device would be rrza18a=2E

    When using mknod=2C insure that the default working directory is =2Fdev=
=2E
    Mknod would be used as follows=3A

    =23cd=2Fdev   =2D puts working directory to =2Fdev
    =23mknod rza18a b 8 34816  =2D creates the block mode special file for =
rza18a
    =23mknod rrza18a c 8 34816 =2D creates the character mode file for rrza=
18a


    For an HSZ40 unit D102 on host side SCSI Bus =232; the SCSI Bus is 2=2C
    the Target ID is 1 and the LUN number is 2=2E  The minor number for
    =22d=22 partition would be=3A

    =28 16384 * 2=29 =2B =28 1024 * 1 =29 =2B =28 64 * 2 =29 =2B 3 =3D 3392=
3

    The =22nn=22 portion of the name would be 18=2C as determined by the fo=
rmula
      nn =3D =28 8 * Host Side SCSI Bus =23 =29 =2B =28 Target ID from HSZ4=
0 unit number=29

    The special file name for the block mode device would be rzc17d=2E
    The special file name for the character mode device would be rrzc17d=2E
    Mknod would be used as follows=3A

    =23cd=2Fdev   =2D puts working directory to =2Fdev
    =23mknod rzc17d b 8 33923  =2D creates the block mode special file for =
rzc17d
    =23mknod rrzc17d c 8 33923 =2D creates the character mode file for rrzc=
17d


