e 25
VIII=2DA=3A EDITING THE CONFIGURATION FILE

        Edit the configuration file as follows=2E

        Enter rz=22nn=22 eight times with a different drive number for each=
 entry=2E
        Even if all 8 LUNS are not available from an HSZ40 Target
        ID=2C all eight entries should exist in the configuration file=2E

        Only the first drive number needs to be calculated=2C for each addi=
tional
        device just add 1 to the previous drive number=2E

      EXAMPLE =3A

      For HSZ40 units D0 =2D D7 on Host Side SCSI Bus =23 2=2C the entries
      in the configuration file would be=3A

        bus             tcds0      at tc0       slot  6 vector    tcdsintr
        bus             tza0       at tc0       slot  5 vector    tzaintr
        controller      scsi2      at tza0      slot  0
        device disk     rz16       at scsi2     drive     128
        device disk     rz16       at scsi2     drive     129
        device disk     rz16       at scsi2     drive     130
        device disk     rz16       at scsi2     drive     131
        device disk     rz16       at scsi2     drive     132
        device disk     rz16       at scsi2     drive     133
        device disk     rz16       at scsi2     drive     134
        device disk     rz16       at scsi2     drive     135

      EXAMPLE =3A

      For HSZ40 units D400 =2D D407 on Host Side SCSI Bus =23 5=2C the entr=
ies in the
      configuration file would be=3A

        bus             tcds0      at tc0       slot  6 vector    tcdsintr
        bus             tza0       at tc0       slot  5 vector    tzaintr
        controller      scsi5      at tza0      slot  0
        device disk     rz44       at scsi5     drive     352
        device disk     rz44       at scsi5     drive     353
        device disk     rz44       at scsi5     drive     354
        device disk     rz44       at scsi5     drive     355


        device disk     rz44       at scsi5     drive     356
        device disk     rz44       at scsi5     drive     357
        device disk     rz44       at scsi5     drive     358
        device disk     rz44       at scsi5     drive     359

  NOTE=3A =21=21=21

      Even if the HSZ40 does not present all eight LUNS using the same
      Target ID=2C all eight entries for the LUNS 0 =2D 7 must be in the
      configuration file=2E  The reason for this will be explained in the n=
ext
      section=2E

      That is=2C if an HSZ40 only has units D100=2C and D101=2C all devices
      that relate to HSZ40 units D100 =2D D107 should be in the configurati=
on
      file=2E

