     The question was:
     
     >      Is there a way in software or via any Unix utility to
     >      select which slot will be active in a 4 tape TLZ07 tape drive. 
     >
     >      Machine is a 4100 running 4.0B. >
     >      Basically, I want to be able to emulate the pressing of the 
     slot >      select button on the front panel.
