     The answers were:
     
     Here are the options (most desirable first):
     
     1.  The easiest thing is probably
     to install and configure the layered product
     CLCMC311 (CAM Medium Changer Driver V3.1A). This gives
     you the `mcutil' program that does selective tape insertion from the 
     jukebox.
     
     2.  As far as actually selecting a slot other than the next in order, 
     you may want to look into MRU (Media Robot Utility), but I'm not sure 
     if it supports TLZ07s.
     
     
     Thanks to all,
     Bob 
     

