	solve the problem. Unfortunately, my last SPL is July 1997 and
	contains O3D software 4.4 (I perform the upgrade from release
	4.3, but the problem still remains).

	Tom Blinn (from DEC) pointed out that there could be a memory leak
	in the Xdec software that may be exacerbated by some application I
	am running: that's true. I am using the PowerStorm 4D60T (as detected
